      "role": "user",
      "content": "resilience? i dont know about that. it feels more like i'm just performing. people look at me and they don't see a person, they see a cautionary tale. a mistake. how am i supposed to \"be kind\" to someone who doesn't even exist anymore? the person who actually mattered is dead. there's nothing left to build back.",
